### Initial access policy

| Feature | Free access | Premium access |
|---|---|---|
| Registration | Yes | Yes |
| Basic profile | Yes | Yes |
| Course catalogue | Yes | Yes |
| Course outlines | Yes | Yes |
| Designated free lessons | Yes | Yes |
| Premium lessons | No | Yes, if included |
